        "noteContent": "Layer editor: LSTM (input 1, hidden 32) reads the 30 steps, SelectIndex keeps the last step's output, Linear maps 32 numbers to the forecast.\n\n圖層編輯器：LSTM（input 1、hidden 32）讀入 30 步，SelectIndex 留下最後一步的輸出，Linear 把 32 個數字對應成預測值。",
        "noteColor": "#3d3d1a",
